{"sectionId":"cell/organelles","items":[{"id":"cell--organelles-k001","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"원핵세포는 막으로 둘러싸인 핵을 갖지 않으며 보통 70S 리보솜을 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k002","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"진핵세포의 세포질 리보솜은 80S(40S+60S)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k003","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"S는 침강계수라 산술 합과 다르다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k004","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"핵공은 선택적으로 핵·세포질 물질 이동을 조절하며 인에서는 rRNA 합성과 리보솜 소단위체 조립이 일어난다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k005","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"조면소포체는 분비·막·내막계 단백질의 합성과 초기 가공, 활면소포체는 지질합성·해독·Ca²⁺ 저장에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k006","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"골지체는 cis에서 trans 방향으로 단백질과 지질을 가공하고 분류한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k007","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"리소좀은 산성 내강의 가수분해효소로 물질을 분해한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k008","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"퍼옥시좀은 지방산 산화와 과산화수소 대사에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k009","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"미토콘드리아 내막에는 호흡사슬과 ATP 합성효소, 기질에는 TCA 회로의 대부분 효소가 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k010","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"미토콘드리아 및 엽록체는 세포내공생 기원으로 자체 DNA와 리보솜을 가진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k011","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"리소좀과 퍼옥시좀은 기능과 단백질 표적화 경로가 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k012","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"핵막 외막은 소포체와 연속된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k013","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"숙신산 탈수소효소는 TCA 효소이면서 미토콘드리아 내막의 복합체 II이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--organelles-k014","sectionId":"cell/organelles","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"대개 세포질에서 번역이 시작되고 신호서열 인식 후 소포체로 유도된다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}